{"2736690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Sols", "steam_appid": 2736690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3230080, 3323400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A sprawling, labyrinth stretches out ahead, steeped in shadow. Foes lurk behind every corner, but only through combat and perseverance can you endure. Death is but a lesson, you have no choice but to try again. And again. And again.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world and master how to take down formidable bosses in the minimalist souls-like you've been looking for! On your quest to liberate an enslaved world, you will face off against sword-wielding grunts,  arrow-flinging fiends, and brutal bosses that will test your strength and skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REFINE AND UNLEASH YOUR BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Sols by defeating enemies and exploring a world filled with challenges. Bonfires offer some relief in this unforgiving world, and allow you to tailor and refine your build using your gathered Sols. Equip new weapons, alter your stats, and adapt to the challenges ahead. Just be sure to reclaim your Sols whenever you’re bested by a foe… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A HAND-CRAFTED WORLD TEEMING WITH SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into this abstract fantasy and discover secrets of the world. Explore different biomes and illuminate every corner to find rare items, secret paths, and the truth behind a world plunged into darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE FORMIDABLE FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Sols, every fight is a lesson, and you must master your weapons, skills and movement to take down challenging foes. Turn the tides in your favour by studying your enemies, exploiting their weaknesses, and using their own traps against them. Gain allies, watch for attack patterns, and perfect your timing in combat as you navigate this harsh land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Sols is the perfect distillation of the souls-like genre. With a range of difficulty sliders, you can either ease your way into its unforgiving world as a newcomer or test your mettle against relentless challenges that will push even souls-like veterans to their limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains certain light patterns and flashing lights that could trigger or cause discomfort for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you experience dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitches, loss of awareness, disorientation, any involuntary movement, or convulsions while playing, please immediately discontinue playing Void Sols and consult your doctor.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A sprawling, labyrinth stretches out ahead, steeped in shadow. Foes lurk behind every corner, but only through combat and perseverance can you endure. Death is but a lesson, you have no choice but to try again. And again. And again.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world and master how to take down formidable bosses in the minimalist souls-like you've been looking for! On your quest to liberate an enslaved world, you will face off against sword-wielding grunts,  arrow-flinging fiends, and brutal bosses that will test your strength and skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REFINE AND UNLEASH YOUR BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Sols by defeating enemies and exploring a world filled with challenges. Bonfires offer some relief in this unforgiving world, and allow you to tailor and refine your build using your gathered Sols. Equip new weapons, alter your stats, and adapt to the challenges ahead. Just be sure to reclaim your Sols whenever you’re bested by a foe… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A HAND-CRAFTED WORLD TEEMING WITH SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into this abstract fantasy and discover secrets of the world. Explore different biomes and illuminate every corner to find rare items, secret paths, and the truth behind a world plunged into darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE FORMIDABLE FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Sols, every fight is a lesson, and you must master your weapons, skills and movement to take down challenging foes. Turn the tides in your favour by studying your enemies, exploiting their weaknesses, and using their own traps against them. Gain allies, watch for attack patterns, and perfect your timing in combat as you navigate this harsh land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.poster.avif?t=1759332368\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.webm?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.mp4?t=1759332368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Sols is the perfect distillation of the souls-like genre. With a range of difficulty sliders, you can either ease your way into its unforgiving world as a newcomer or test your mettle against relentless challenges that will push even souls-like veterans to their limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains certain light patterns and flashing lights that could trigger or cause discomfort for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you experience dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitches, loss of awareness, disorientation, any involuntary movement, or convulsions while playing, please immediately discontinue playing Void Sols and consult your doctor.</i></p>", "short_description": "Abstract ruins. Hostile shapes. No escape but forward... Death isn’t the end as you know it. Here, it’s how you grow! Each defeat teaches you more as you rise again to defeat foes with stolen blades and bows. Pushing through a broken world warped by cruelty and shadows. Welcome. This is Void Sols.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“Of all the games to tread in the wake of Dark Souls and Elden Ring, new indie souls-like game Void Sols might be one of the most distinctive and exciting.”<br>PCGamesN<br><br>“Void Sols brings a really experimental spirit to the souls-like genre.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“With its novel use of lighting, Void Sols distills the essence of Souls games into something minimalist and pure, but just as frightening. Perhaps the dawn of the Sols-like is upon us.”<br>Eurogamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/header.jpg?t=1759332368", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/504e842364890ba42ca6e17053bce778bd97e151/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759332368", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/504e842364890ba42ca6e17053bce778bd97e151/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759332368", "website": "https://modernwolf.net/finite-reflection-studios/void-sols", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium G620 (2.5 Ghz dual core) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<